  "title": {
    "bn": "বিকাল সাড়ে পাঁচটা",
    "tr": "bikal share pa~chta",
    "en": "Half past five in the afternoon"
  },
  "summary": "Ages, a cheeky guess, and Nani's favourite time of day.",
  "status": "draft",
  "lines": [
    {
      "bn": "আজ শুক্রবার, বিকাল।",
      "tr": "aj shukrobar, bikal.",
      "en": "It's Friday afternoon."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Nani",
      "bn": "তোমার বয়স কি বিশ?",
      "tr": "tomar boyosh ki bish?",
      "en": "Are you twenty?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Emma",
      "bn": "না, নানি। আমার বয়স ত্রিশ।",
      "tr": "na, nani. amar boyosh trish.",
      "en": "No, Nani. I'm thirty."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Rafi",
      "bn": "নানি, আপনার বয়স কি আশি?",
      "tr": "nani, apnar boyosh ki ashi?",
      "en": "Nani, are you eighty?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Nani",
      "bn": "না! আমার বয়স সত্তর।",
      "tr": "na! amar boyosh shottor.",
      "en": "No! I'm seventy."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Rafi",
      "bn": "আচ্ছা, সত্তর। দুঃখিত, নানি!",
      "tr": "achchha, shottor. dukkhito, nani!",
      "en": "OK, seventy. Sorry, Nani!"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Nani",
      "bn": "এখন কয়টা বাজে?",
      "tr": "ekhon koyta baje?",
      "en": "What time is it now?"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Nadia",
      "bn": "সাড়ে পাঁচটা।",
      "tr": "share pa~chta.",
      "en": "Half past five."
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Nani",
      "bn": "বিকাল সাড়ে পাঁচটা? চা!",
      "tr": "bikal share pa~chta? cha!",
      "en": "Half past five in the afternoon? Tea time!"
    },
    {
      "speaker": "Rafi",
      "bn": "আর মিষ্টি!",
      "tr": "ar mishti!",
      "en": "And sweets!"
    }
  ],
